<title>USA: Virtual Technology names Stockburger as CFO.</title>
<headline>Virtual Technology names Stockburger as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Virtual Technology Corp said Thursday it named Morris Stockburger to the new position of chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Shareholders will vote on his nomination as a director at the company's annual meeting on April 29.</p>
<p>Stockburger had been director of business planning for Cray Research Inc, a unit of Silicon Graphics Inc.</p>
<p>Virtual Technology is a software company.</p>
<p>	 ((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
